Rule 25 (tensor shape matches given tuple shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ndim(v_1) = v_2.len ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = v_2[i]

Rule 28 (list of ints used as dimensions/axes, all non-negative and valid for tensor shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : 0 ≤ v_2[i] ∧ v_2[i] < ndim(v_1)

Rule 13 (tensor must have a floating-point dtype: 6–8)
